    "description": "Fortune Words \u2013 Lucky Spin brings back the good old days of television shows and trivia contests. Delve into the lucky world of words and embrace one of the best free games.\r\n\r\nFortune Words \u2013 Lucky Spin challenges you with spinning a wheel for money to reveal hidden sentences. Each puzzle presents a mature theme as the game strives to be a top contender among the free games for adults. Luck plays a big part in this word money game filled with competition and luxury. \r\n\r\nStart by spinning a random money prize. Pick a correct letter to earn that money and get ahead of opponents. Each letter reveals a tiny part of the big sentence word puzzle and brings you one step closer to victory. While you are figuring out the sentence, two tough rivals also make their spins and enjoy a wheel of fortune free play game. \r\n\r\nPlayers can buy a vowel when they get stuck and gain extra clues on the answer. You must be careful though as it might put your winning chances into jeopardy. Because your rivals will also see the revealed letters and they can guess the answer before you! You will eventually win the contest and feel like a family and feud star. This is why you can find word puzzle games among the most popular games for free.\r\n\r\nLuck brings excitement just like in any other casino or slot game. Spin that wheel for accumulating great wealth and fortune. Use the money to buy luxury items and live the life of fame and luxury. You won\u2019t be able to drop the phone as addicting games with word puzzle spins are here to keep you occupied.\r\n\r\nThe spin wheel has plenty of rewards and surprising outcomes. You can win great, but also can lose everything. The fortune for wheel will decide your fate in many unexpected ways. This lucky fun game aims to scratch your itch for a good casino royale game.  Adult free games category enthusiasts will feel at home from the very beginning of Fortune Words \u2013 Lucky Spin.\r\n\r\nEven the word and crossword puzzle game experts will feel the challenge as this game is not a mere word search experience. The answer table offers letters and clues, but you can try to reveal more before making a guess. Guessing wrongly skips your turn and you give your chances of winning to your rivals. A feud for all families and a fortune of wheel action awaits you! \r\n\r\nFortune Words \u2013Lucky Spin has bonus levels that challenge even the most veteran wheel of fortune experts. As one of the adult games, bonus levels are hard, tough, and cause much excitement! The countdown does not let you think too long and play the game like a true free adult gamer. As a game for seniors, Fortune Words test your vocabulary and dictionary knowledge. Not only that, your pop culture trove will be put into a test of time and ruzzle.\r\n\r\nNew York games keep players occupied daily with word puzzles and multiplayer challenges, yet Fortune Words takes the system one step ahead by giving the players a chance to rise up through the wealth leagues. Climb up the leaderboards and prove your mettle! Each week, the top 10 players advance into a higher league and face more fierce opponents. The elite players can reach the Diamond League and write their names on the hall of fame!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u25cf TV show quality atmosphere and puzzles\r\n\u25cf Fortune spins\r\n\u25cf Wealth customization system that offers luxury and fame\r\n\u25cf Three types of boosters to help adult gamers\r\n\u25cf Stunning visuals with wheel for fortune quality graphics\r\n\u25cf Challenging rivals that spice up the contest\r\n\u25cf Huge database of word trivia puzzles\r\n\u25cf Big selection of avatars\r\n\u25cf Tiered league system that offers a long term competition\r\n\u25cf Engaging sound effects\r\n\u25cf Free to play\r\n\u25cf Free games for adults\r\n\u25cf Can be played offline\r\n\u25cf Truly offline gameplay\r\n\u25cf No internet required\r\n\u25cf Inspired by famous TV shows about families competing and cont